# Lets the device owner (and anyone else evermore-enroll later adds to the
# wheel group) administer their own machine -- install packages, manage
# services, etc. Password-gated, not NOPASSWD: the owner already proved
# their identity unlocking their LUKS home, but a second factor before
# root-equivalent actions is still worth the one extra prompt. Arch's own
# /etc/sudoers ships the equivalent %wheel line commented out; this is a
# drop-in instead of uncommenting that line so it survives untouched if the
# base image's sudoers file is ever regenerated.
%wheel ALL=(ALL:ALL) ALL
